# TVED Activity & Task Tracking System

Bilingual (Lao default + English) admin portal + public CMS for TVED, Lao PDR.
Stack: React 19 + Vite + Tailwind (TailAdmin) / Express 5 + PostgreSQL (`tvet_portal`) / JWT.

## Must follow
- Visibility via `HierarchyService.visibleUserIds` + `ActivityPolicy` only — no inline role checks for data access.
- Role data scopes: own | direct_reports | division | assigned_divisions | department.
- Positions ≠ reporting line (`supervisor_id`).
- Lao default locale; paired `*_lo`/`*_en` columns; English optional with Lao fallback.
- PDF via Puppeteer only (Lao fonts). Fat services, thin controllers.
- No public signup — Super Admin creates accounts.
- Do not substitute Laravel or invent APIs. Extend existing Express/React patterns.
- Migrations are append-only. Soft-deactivate users; never hard-delete with activities.

See `CLAUDE.md` and `refdocs/TVED-Development-Plan.md` for full domain rules.
